=\"mgz-panel-body\" ><div class=\"mgz-panel-body-inner\"><div class=\"f9oioh6 mgz-element mgz-element-accordion_section\"><div class=\"mgz-element-inner f9oioh6-s\"><div class=\"y1fsi25 mgz-element mgz-child mgz-element-text\"><div class=\"mgz-element-inner y1fsi25-s\"><p>Philip Kingsley Virtual Consultation takes place via video call. Your Consultation lasts between 45-60 minutes, giving your Trichologist time to explore all factors affecting your hair and scalp; such as general health, diet and lifestyle, and your medical and family history.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mgz-panel \"><div class=\"mgz-panel-heading mgz-text-left mgz-icon-position-right\"><h4 class=\"mgz-panel-heading-title\"><a href=\"#tab-tnq3j5a\" class=\"has-icon\"><i class=\"mgz-accoridon-icon-plus \"></i> <span>Where is the Clinic located? </span></a></h4></div><div class=\"mgz-panel-body\" ><div class=\"mgz-panel-body-inner\"><div class=\"tnq3j5a mgz-element mgz-element-accordion_section\"><div class=\"mgz-element-inner tnq3j5a-s\"><div class=\"hpcvadl mgz-element mgz-child mgz-element-text\"><div class=\"mgz-element-inner hpcvadl-s\"><p>Our London Clinic is located in the heart of Mayfair. You can find us at 54 Green Street, London, W1K 6RU.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mgz-panel mgz-panel-last\"><div class=\"mgz-panel-heading mgz-text-left mgz-icon-position-right\"><h4 class=\"mgz-panel-heading-title\"><a href=\"#tab-ij49mm3\" class=\"has-icon\"><i class=\"mgz-accoridon-icon-plus \"></i> <span>What's the difference between In-Clinic and Virtual Consultations? </span></a></h4></div><div class=\"mgz-panel-body\" ><div class=\"mgz-panel-body-inner\"><div class=\"ij49mm3 mgz-element mgz-element-accordion_section\"><div class=\"mgz-element-inner ij49mm3-s\"><div class=\"ia26crn mgz-element mgz-child mgz-element-text\"><div class=\"mgz-element-inner ia26crn-s\"><p>Our In-Clinic Consultations are the most in-depth and accurate Consultations as we can thoroughly assess your hair &amp; scalp with the tools we have at the Clinic. Our In-Clinic Consultations are also followed by a Treatment to treat your hair &amp; scalp immediately after seeing our Trichologists. <br><br>Our Virtual Consultations are a video call with one of our Trichologists. We will still take a full history and assess the photos of your hair &amp; sclap you share with us before, but we can't guarantee a diagnosis on the call and wemay suggest you need a visit to the Clinic for a full diagnosis. You will however, still get access to our full range of exclusive treatment plans. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><style class=\"mgz-style\">.p2wu3nv-s{margin-bottom:30px !important;}.mgz-element.p2wu3nv .mgz-panels-p2wu3nv > .mgz-panel > .mgz-panel-heading{border-width:1px;border-radius:0px;background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);border-color:#dbdbdb;}.mgz-element.p2wu3nv .mgz-panels-p2wu3nv > .mgz-panel > .mgz-panel-body{background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);border-width:1px;border-radius:0px;}.mgz-element.p2wu3nv .mgz-panels-p2wu3nv > .mgz-panel > .mgz-panel-body > .mgz-panel-body-inner{padding:0 45px 20px;}</style></div></div><div id=\"proceed-booking-btn\" class=\"o7ykt0p mgz-element mgz-child mgz-element-button phorest-booking-link\"><div class=\"mgz-element-inner o7ykt0p-s\"><div class=\"mgz-button mgz-btn-style-modern mgz-btn-size-md\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"mgz-link mgz-btn\" title=\"\" > BOOK A CONSULTATION </a></div><style class=\"mgz-style\">.o7ykt0p-s{text-align:center;}.mgz-element.o7ykt0p .mgz-link{color:#ffffff;background-color:#163d29;width:100%;}.mgz-element.o7ykt0p .mgz-link{color:#ffffff;background-color:#163d29;width:100%;}</style></div></div><div class=\"ma5s8p3 mgz-element mgz-child mgz-element-raw_html\"><div class=\"mgz-element-inner ma5s8p3-s\"><div class=\"pk-quiz-button pk-quiz-control\" onclick=\"quiz.resetAnswers()\"><span>Start Assessment Again</span> </div></div></div></div></div></div><